<section class="review-section" id="overview">
<h2><svg class="neon-icon" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M16 4h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H6a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2"></path><rect height="4" rx="1" ry="1" width="8" x="8" y="2"></rect></svg> Overview</h2>
<p>Spacemaker AI is an enterprise-grade AI platform for site planning and urban design, acquired by Autodesk in 2020. It specializes in optimizing building placement, analyzing environmental factors, and maximizing site potential for large-scale development projects. With over 10,000 projects completed, Spacemaker has become the industry standard for data-driven urban planning.</p>
<p>The platform uses sophisticated AI algorithms to explore thousands of site layout options, evaluating each against multiple criteria including solar exposure, noise levels, wind patterns, views, and regulatory constraints. This allows developers and architects to make informed decisions backed by quantitative environmental analysis.</p>
<p>What makes Spacemaker particularly powerful is its integration with Autodesk's ecosystem. Projects can flow seamlessly from early-stage site planning in Spacemaker to detailed design in Revit, maintaining data consistency throughout the workflow. This makes it ideal for large development firms working on mixed-use and multi-building projects.</p>
<div class="spacemaker-highlight">
<h4><svg class="neon-icon" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="6"></circle><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="2"></circle></svg> Enterprise Site Optimization</h4>
<p style="margin: 0;">Spacemaker can evaluate thousands of building placement scenarios in minutes, analyzing solar access, noise pollution, wind patterns, and views to find optimal site layouts.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section class="review-section" id="features">
<h2><svg class="neon-icon" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"></polygon></svg> Key Features</h2>
<div class="features-grid">
<div class="feature-card"><h4><svg class="neon-icon" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M3 21h18"></path><path d="M9 8h10"></path><path d="M9 14h10"></path><path d="M9 20h10"></path><path d="M3 8l3-3 3 3"></path></svg> Site Layout Optimization</h4><p>AI explores thousands of building placement options based on site constraints and development goals. Maximizes unit count while maintaining quality standards.</p></div>
<div class="feature-card"><h4><svg class="neon-icon" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><line x1="2" y1="12" x2="22" y2="12"/><path d="M12 2a15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4-10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4-10z"/></svg> Environmental Analysis</h4><p>Comprehensive environmental simulations including solar, wind, noise, and microclimate analysis. Real-world data integration for accurate results.</p></div>
<div class="feature-card"><h4>☀️ Solar Study</h4><p>Detailed solar exposure analysis for buildings and outdoor spaces. Optimize apartment layouts for natural daylight and minimize overshadowing.</p></div>
<div class="feature-card"><h4><svg class="neon-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polygon points="11 5 6 9 2 9 2 15 6 15 11 19 11 5"/><path d="M19.07 4.93a10 10 0 0 1 0 14.14M15.54 8.46a5 5 0 0 1 0 7.07"/></svg> Noise Simulation</h4><p>Traffic and urban noise propagation modeling. Optimize building orientation and placement to minimize noise pollution for residential units.</p></div>
<div class="feature-card"><h4>💨 Wind Analysis</h4><p>CFD-based wind flow simulation around buildings. Identify problematic wind tunnels and optimize outdoor comfort for pedestrian areas.</p></div>
<div class="feature-card"><h4>🏘️ Building Placement</h4><p>Intelligent building positioning considering views, privacy, circulation, and density requirements. Respects setbacks and zoning regulations.</p></div>
<div class="feature-card"><h4><svg class="neon-icon" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><line x1="18" x2="18" y1="20" y2="10"></line><line x1="12" x2="12" y1="20" y2="4"></line><line x1="6" x2="6" y1="20" y2="14"></line></svg> Density Optimization</h4><p>Maximize development potential while maintaining livability. Balance unit count, open space, parking, and environmental quality metrics.</p></div>
<div class="feature-card"><h4><svg class="neon-icon" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M16 4h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H6a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2"></path><rect height="4" rx="1" ry="1" width="8" x="8" y="2"></rect></svg> Regulatory Compliance</h4><p>Built-in code checking for zoning, setbacks, height limits, and FAR requirements. Flags non-compliant designs automatically.</p></div>
</div>
</section>
